# Everything text checks out LF everywhere. Without it, Git for Windows'
# core.autocrlf=true would hand a Windows contributor's checkout CRLF versions
# of scripts/*.sh and docker/*, which shellcheck and hadolint both run against
# unmodified in CI. This repo has no Windows CI leg; it is cheap correctness
# either way.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are never text: no line-ending conversion, no textual diff or merge.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
